0.245Z"}]}'::jsonb, E'Daily Work Report\n\n1. Marketing Agency Outreach: Contacted marketing agencies to explore potential collaborations for promoting company internship programs and increasing student registrations. Initiated discussions regarding marketing strategies, outreach methods, and registration support.\n\n2. SSR Project – Component Sourcing: Worked on identifying and sourcing the required electronic components for the SSR project. Reviewed component specifications, availability, and potential suppliers to support project development and procurement planning.', E'admin', E'approved', E'gkbharath', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2026-10-28T11:26:27.759Z', E'2026-10-30T05:59:58.410Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO NOTHING;
